contentText:
Lil Jon stopped by ABC&#8217;s Nightline to promote his recently released memoir I Only Shout So You Can Hear Me and touched on some pretty emotional topics.

While speaking with ABC News correspondent Stephanie Ramos for Wednesday night&#8217;s (Oct. 21) episode, the Atlanta producer talked about how he felt when he found out that the father that raised him wasn&#8217;t his biological father.

